window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>\"What happened between the four of us—it changes everything.\"<br> <br> Everything in my life has been turned on its head. My allies have become enemies, and my enemies have become...<br> <br> I don't even know what.<br> <br> There's no denying the pull between me and each of the Icons anymore. I've denied it long enough, and I'm done letting secrets fester between us.<br> <br> I know they want me too. But how am I supposed to choose between them?<br> <br> Why do I have to?</p> <p><i>This is the final book in the Clearwater University series, a new adult reverse harem enemies to lovers romance. It contains cursing and steam.</i></p>"; 
